1
00:02:03,898 --> 00:02:08,338
No living creature was hurt during
the production of this show.

2
00:02:09,041 --> 00:02:11,871
2 DAYS LATER

3
00:02:32,805 --> 00:02:36,125
Bala Hatun, where do we put
the dowry of bride?

4
00:02:37,525 --> 00:02:41,135
Put it in the tent our Bey and
Malhun Hatun will stay, Baysungur.

5
00:03:03,927 --> 00:03:06,672
My Osman, you told me that
everything was fine.

6
00:03:06,672 --> 00:03:09,515
Does it mean Umur Bey and his
tribe won't leave?

7
00:03:09,515 --> 00:03:11,505
They're not leaving, my Bala.

8
00:03:12,451 --> 00:03:15,931
- Then, to merge two tribes...
- To merge two tribes...

9
00:03:16,250 --> 00:03:18,920
Umur Bey wanted a marriage.

10
00:03:18,947 --> 00:03:20,957
What was your reply?

11
00:03:21,597 --> 00:03:23,817
We'll have a wedding, my Bala.

12
00:03:24,588 --> 00:03:26,978
Let the preparations begin.

13
00:03:40,801 --> 00:03:43,481
Take care of bride's caravan, Gonca.

14
00:03:45,333 --> 00:03:47,683
Don't worry, my Bala.

15
00:04:09,566 --> 00:04:11,716
Salam Aleikum, my Sheik.

16
00:04:12,733 --> 00:04:15,423
Alaikum Salam.

17
00:04:17,201 --> 00:04:21,821
Osman Bey, who cares for his people...

18
00:04:22,003 --> 00:04:28,063
who was given his role by Lord.

19
00:04:28,836 --> 00:04:30,181
Welcome.

20
00:04:30,181 --> 00:04:33,057
You are flattering me, my Sheik.

21
00:04:33,057 --> 00:04:38,477
No, no.
You decided on the marriage...

22
00:04:38,749 --> 00:04:43,249
at the cost of upsetting your love.

23
00:04:44,568 --> 00:04:50,468
This decision could be made only by
a Bey who really cares for the future.

24
00:04:51,489 --> 00:04:59,169
And also, only a Hatun who values her Bey
would consent to this decision.

25
00:05:01,325 --> 00:05:04,078
We are proud of you both.

26
00:05:04,078 --> 00:05:06,597
May my Lord bless you.

27
00:05:06,597 --> 00:05:09,177
May Allah bless you, my Sheik.

28
00:05:11,589 --> 00:05:16,539
Turkmen Beys are going to attend
in the wedding tomorrow.

29
00:05:17,340 --> 00:05:19,320
May it be blessed.

30
00:05:19,372 --> 00:05:21,722
Amin, my Sheik.

31
00:05:25,098 --> 00:05:28,468
Osman Bey, may your family
become a beyship...

32
00:05:28,730 --> 00:05:33,640
Your beyship become a state, your alps
become an army inshallah.

33
00:05:35,675 --> 00:05:37,515
Inshallah.

34
00:05:39,553 --> 00:05:41,503
Now, tell me.

35
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:49,649
What do you need now?

36
00:05:51,810 --> 00:05:55,980
Our traditions must be laws, our castle's
be cities...

37
00:05:56,099 --> 00:05:59,779
our people be victorious, my Sheik.

38
00:06:01,142 --> 00:06:05,182
Everywhere we conquer shall be our land.

39
00:06:05,894 --> 00:06:09,244
Also, our people...

40
00:06:10,634 --> 00:06:13,594
must be satisfied by our govern.

41
00:06:15,488 --> 00:06:17,938
You are right, Osman Bey.

42
00:06:18,594 --> 00:06:23,684
What is your plan for Sogut?

43
00:06:24,517 --> 00:06:28,897
I requested master builders from
the cities around.

44
00:06:28,991 --> 00:06:30,761
They'll be working soon.

45
00:06:32,641 --> 00:06:35,151
Mashallah (praise be).

46
00:06:35,925 --> 00:06:41,155
While you are doing all of the works...

47
00:06:41,602 --> 00:06:46,562
you should also care for
non-Muslims' rights.

48
00:06:47,225 --> 00:06:54,515
As you know, sun shines the same
for everyone.

49
00:06:59,431 --> 00:07:04,191
You need to be fair to everyone.

50
00:07:04,902 --> 00:07:08,992
- Until...
- Until our traditions be like sun...

51
00:07:09,003 --> 00:07:11,813
and shines all the people.

52
00:07:12,832 --> 00:07:18,502
Kayıs' shall shine, our beyship shall
become a state.

53
00:07:24,312 --> 00:07:26,012
I shall leave, my Sheik.

54
00:07:35,233 --> 00:07:39,412
Bilecik Governor is back, my Bey.

55
00:07:39,412 --> 00:07:42,550
Good, good. I want to see him.

56
00:07:42,550 --> 00:07:45,590
- Send him my invitation.
- Eyvallah my Bey.

57
00:07:46,263 --> 00:07:48,753
Did you send my invitation to
Sultan Mesud's man?

58
00:07:48,753 --> 00:07:51,180
He is already on his way, my Bey.

59
00:07:51,180 --> 00:07:52,813
Eyvallah. (thank you).

60
00:07:52,953 --> 00:07:54,693
Have a nice day.

61
00:07:55,433 --> 00:07:57,843
- Have a nice day.
- Osman Bey.

62
00:08:08,154 --> 00:08:11,302
Oh, Mashallah (praise be)

63
00:08:11,302 --> 00:08:14,942
- You show a great care in those.
- I picked them this morning, my Bey.

64
00:08:17,117 --> 00:08:23,717
Goktug, buy all the fruits and vegetables
for the wedding from this Hatun.

65
00:08:28,411 --> 00:08:30,911
Of course my Bey.

66
00:08:35,563 --> 00:08:38,403
Have a nice one.

67
00:08:42,938 --> 00:08:44,738
I'll join you.

68
00:08:46,184 --> 00:08:49,614
Welcome, Osman Bey.

69
00:09:02,333 --> 00:09:05,533
- These are not enough.
- All of them?

70
00:09:06,059 --> 00:09:08,309
These would last months.

71
00:09:11,234 --> 00:09:13,334
How many people will there be?

72
00:09:13,443 --> 00:09:15,823
Haven't you seen a Turkish wedding?

73
00:09:16,697 --> 00:09:18,707
It's also about whose wedding it is.

74
00:09:19,385 --> 00:09:22,725
How can I know? I haven't
been in a Turkish wedding.

75
00:09:24,767 --> 00:09:31,337
You can stay in the tent to help
Kayı Hatuns if you want to.

76
00:09:33,938 --> 00:09:35,598
I'd love to.

77
00:09:42,217 --> 00:09:45,507
Then, have a good day.

78
00:09:58,300 --> 00:10:00,970
- Have a nice day.
- Eyvallah (thank you) my Bey.

79
00:10:02,348 --> 00:10:05,718
- One more to visit.
- Eyvallah (okay) my Bey.

80
00:10:37,397 --> 00:10:39,517
This is my mother's keepsake.

81
00:10:41,624 --> 00:10:44,164
My tall mother's keepsake.

82
00:10:45,885 --> 00:10:49,805
She had dark hair.

83
00:10:51,022 --> 00:10:54,302
She passed her beauty to you.

84
00:11:03,076 --> 00:11:05,356
I have been your confidant
since childhood.

85
00:11:06,089 --> 00:11:09,739
Tell me why you are upset.

86
00:11:15,227 --> 00:11:18,447
I am about to leave
my role and tent, Alaca.

87
00:11:19,286 --> 00:11:21,386
I was my father's right arm.

88
00:11:22,838 --> 00:11:25,708
The sharp sword of Kızılbeyogullari.

89
00:11:26,586 --> 00:11:28,886
Now I am leaving all behind.

90
00:11:29,075 --> 00:11:32,395
You are leaving for Osman Bey...

91
00:11:33,918 --> 00:11:36,318
who you wanted.

92
00:11:40,020 --> 00:11:43,710
I am going to someone who has someone
else in his heart other than me.

93
00:11:54,053 --> 00:11:56,353
Why are you upset?

94
00:11:57,114 --> 00:11:59,464
You are leaving.

95
00:11:59,685 --> 00:12:01,215
So?

96
00:12:02,554 --> 00:12:04,644
What am I going to do?

97
00:12:05,748 --> 00:12:08,248
Why are we preparing all these, Alaca?

98
00:12:08,739 --> 00:12:11,055
Because a bride has to have a dowry.

99
00:12:11,055 --> 00:12:13,765
And a Bey's daughter has to have a friend.

100
00:12:16,205 --> 00:12:18,715
So you are taking me with you.

101
00:12:18,885 --> 00:12:21,335
You come with me wherever I go.

102
00:12:58,349 --> 00:13:03,559
Betrayal woke the dark souls up!

103
00:13:03,780 --> 00:13:06,709
Dark swears are out!

104
00:13:06,709 --> 00:13:15,059
All the soldiers will die until I find
who betrayed Togay!

105
00:13:20,119 --> 00:13:21,369
No!

106
00:13:50,100 --> 00:13:55,337
Was it you who worked with Yargucu?

107
00:13:55,337 --> 00:13:58,457
It was not me, Togay.
I do not betray you.

108
00:14:03,574 --> 00:14:08,664
I'll scratch your traitor eyes out.

109
00:14:15,758 --> 00:14:20,728
You didn't obey me.

110
00:14:21,105 --> 00:14:24,895
I'll let Yargucu eat your eyes.

111
00:14:34,446 --> 00:14:38,626
I'll put your eyes out when you wake up.

112
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:41,750
Next.

113
00:15:02,066 --> 00:15:03,896
Camuha.

114
00:15:04,580 --> 00:15:06,650
They are all innocent.

115
00:15:09,370 --> 00:15:16,030
I was Yargucu's spy.

116
00:15:16,410 --> 00:15:19,510
I am the one who betrayed!

117
00:16:27,211 --> 00:16:28,671
Nicola.

118
00:16:33,208 --> 00:16:35,898
You haven't had a proper meal for days.

119
00:16:37,599 --> 00:16:41,719
I was going to enjoy watching them
killing each other.

120
00:16:43,416 --> 00:16:46,526
Umur and Osman was going to be
each other's enemies.

121
00:16:47,250 --> 00:16:52,060
Togay was going to attack like a
hungry wolf

122
00:16:56,902 --> 00:17:00,052
But what about now?

123
00:17:00,802 --> 00:17:05,722
They'll unite and attack us!

124
00:17:09,476 --> 00:17:13,586
Forget about Umur Bey,
he is useless now.

125
00:17:13,724 --> 00:17:17,844
Togay...
Togay...

126
00:17:19,579 --> 00:17:25,079
We have to remind him who he really is.

127
00:17:25,759 --> 00:17:28,381
There's no other way.

128
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,100
How?

129
00:17:33,852 --> 00:17:35,452
He'll come here.

130
00:17:37,683 --> 00:17:39,853
He'll come to me.

131
00:17:41,162 --> 00:17:47,162
He'll come to me sooner or later
to spit venom.

132
00:17:48,036 --> 00:17:49,946
He'll come!

133
00:17:50,178 --> 00:17:52,478
He'll come to me.

134
00:17:55,212 --> 00:17:57,232
He'll come here.

135
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:07,090
I told that I'd made a sheath for my sword
out of the traitor's scalp.

136
00:18:07,978 --> 00:18:13,978
I'll scalp you, Cumo.

137
00:18:22,827 --> 00:18:24,627
It's your right.

138
00:18:25,262 --> 00:18:27,273
Why did you betray me.

139
00:18:27,273 --> 00:18:31,836
I have always been loyal to you
in my entire life.

140
00:18:31,836 --> 00:18:35,146
Is this why you betrayed me?

141
00:18:35,390 --> 00:18:40,080
I was scared that you'd disobey Geyhatu
and Genghis Khan laws...

142
00:18:40,443 --> 00:18:43,923
when you rejected Yargucu.

143
00:18:44,112 --> 00:18:46,602
I did this because of my loyalty

144
00:18:46,946 --> 00:18:51,256
Now kill me, release soldiers.

145
00:18:59,791 --> 00:19:05,261
Togay is as free as the horses running
on Khan Tengri.

146
00:19:05,817 --> 00:19:11,837
Togay is ready to die in the name of
Genghis Khan.

147
00:19:12,231 --> 00:19:17,541
Yargucu is dead for Togay!

148
00:19:18,396 --> 00:19:25,396
There's no gold, no taxes from now on!

149
00:19:26,493 --> 00:19:31,793
There will only be Togay's dark swear!

150
00:19:34,144 --> 00:19:39,484
Why don't you accept that disobeying
Yargucu means disobeying Geyhatu?

151
00:20:21,743 --> 00:20:26,475
Some stupid Yargucu
cannot show me the way.

152
00:20:26,475 --> 00:20:30,865
Genghis Khan shows me the way.
I take orders from him.

153
00:20:30,884 --> 00:20:37,174
I don't take orders from anyone else.

154
00:20:38,268 --> 00:20:41,878
Forgive me, Togay, forgive.

155
00:20:42,339 --> 00:20:48,149
Either you stand with Togay
for the sake of Genghis Khan laws...

156
00:20:48,185 --> 00:20:51,255
or you die.

157
00:20:52,056 --> 00:20:59,036
I'll obey Genghis Khan laws and the
protector of all Togay until I die.

158
00:20:59,755 --> 00:21:03,295
I did everything for you, Togay.

159
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:18,401
You sad war was coming.

160
00:21:22,384 --> 00:21:27,424
You overcame the enemy by letting them
think that you obeyed Mongols.

161
00:21:28,533 --> 00:21:30,883
You set them against each other.

162
00:21:31,232 --> 00:21:36,582
Now you are ready to trample
them both...

163
00:21:37,118 --> 00:21:39,738
under your horses.

164
00:21:41,562 --> 00:21:43,392
With the help of Allah.

165
00:21:44,292 --> 00:21:48,782
Turks are parted in this land.

166
00:21:49,818 --> 00:21:52,658
We scattered like sheep without shepherd.

167
00:21:52,707 --> 00:21:55,257
Conquest is oblivion.

168
00:21:56,412 --> 00:22:00,732
Our people are parted.

169
00:22:02,164 --> 00:22:04,944
Karamanoglu wants Konya.

170
00:22:05,458 --> 00:22:08,648
Germinyanoglu wants Enguru.

171
00:22:09,130 --> 00:22:12,030
Hamidoglu wants Germiyan.

172
00:22:12,402 --> 00:22:15,342
All are Turkish lands.

173
00:22:15,884 --> 00:22:21,524
All are Turk.
You are fighting against the infidel.

174
00:22:22,038 --> 00:22:28,558
None Turkish Bey can bother you.

175
00:22:29,843 --> 00:22:35,213
Sultan told me Karamanogullari wanted
Konya.

176
00:22:37,046 --> 00:22:42,046
However, as you said, what business could
Turkmen Beys have...

177
00:22:43,108 --> 00:22:45,518
in our land?

178
00:22:46,018 --> 00:22:49,218
We are surrounded by Byzantine.

179
00:22:49,370 --> 00:22:51,590
They don't have any, Osman Bey.

180
00:22:52,351 --> 00:22:55,971
Be sure about yourself so that...

181
00:22:56,587 --> 00:23:00,587
you can destroy the enemy.

182
00:23:01,758 --> 00:23:06,548
Even if it was just me left alone,
as Ertugrul Ghazi Bey's Osman Bey...

183
00:23:06,890 --> 00:23:14,420
I'll fight until the last breath of mine
for my Lord.

184
00:23:15,838 --> 00:23:20,178
We know what happened in Konya.

185
00:23:21,500 --> 00:23:27,720
Sultan Mesud knows what is going on.

186
00:23:28,229 --> 00:23:33,199
Seljuqs are just a shadow now.

187
00:23:34,963 --> 00:23:38,533
Our Sultan can see everything.

188
00:23:38,616 --> 00:23:41,156
I can say that.

189
00:23:41,259 --> 00:23:47,029
But this shadow is above all the
Turkish Beys.

190
00:23:48,502 --> 00:23:56,642
That he supports you was an important
step for you to manage all the Beys.

191
00:23:59,767 --> 00:24:05,377
To end the conflict between
me and Kızılbey's son Umur Bey...

192
00:24:06,165 --> 00:24:11,105
I decided to marry Malhun Hatun.
I am also here to inform you about this.

193
00:24:12,360 --> 00:24:15,060
We already know, Osman Bey.

194
00:24:37,960 --> 00:24:43,810
For Turkmens, this is a
priceless merge.

195
00:24:44,746 --> 00:24:50,766
This priceless dagger is our wedding gift.

196
00:25:01,746 --> 00:25:06,976
It is a keepsake from our ancestor...

197
00:25:07,570 --> 00:25:10,900
Iznik's conquer Suleiman Shah.

198
00:25:18,163 --> 00:25:25,613
May my Lord help me conquer Iznik,
where the Byzantine took away from...

199
00:25:25,613 --> 00:25:28,683
our glorious Sultan.

200
00:25:29,092 --> 00:25:34,862
This dagger shall witness
it is in good hands.

201
00:25:36,359 --> 00:25:38,369
Amin.

202
00:25:39,256 --> 00:25:45,276
I'll work hard. We'll conquer Iznik
someday, inshallah.

203
00:25:46,048 --> 00:25:50,298
Inshallah (if Allah permits)
Osman Bey.

204
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:54,400
A man is always ambitious.

205
00:26:04,092 --> 00:26:09,052
To take revenge that my father Noyan
left unfinished...

206
00:26:09,179 --> 00:26:13,659
For Genghis Khan's bequest...

207
00:26:13,751 --> 00:26:18,691
I am going to die for my dark swear
with souls.

208
00:26:19,715 --> 00:26:26,895
I'll die with my honor instead of
being a coward like...

209
00:26:27,192 --> 00:26:29,592
Yargucu.

210
00:26:30,803 --> 00:26:35,163
If there is anyone who is scared
to take this way...

211
00:26:35,300 --> 00:26:37,671
they shall leave now!

212
00:26:37,671 --> 00:26:42,041
I have no business with cowards!

213
00:27:11,679 --> 00:27:16,199
The wrath of souls shall be with you.

214
00:27:18,698 --> 00:27:20,608
Leave!

215
00:27:26,357 --> 00:27:31,927
Camo, bid your farewell to these cowards...

216
00:27:32,496 --> 00:27:35,806
who disobeyed Genghis Khan laws.

217
00:27:39,539 --> 00:27:43,269
We are less in number.
You can convince them.

218
00:27:43,341 --> 00:27:46,561
They are dead to me!

219
00:27:47,943 --> 00:27:52,033
Don't worry, we'll have new soldiers.

220
00:27:53,008 --> 00:27:57,048
My new soldier for the laws of
Genghis Khan...

221
00:27:59,068 --> 00:28:01,629
will be Nico.

222
00:28:01,629 --> 00:28:04,939
Nico will hear we disobeyed Yargucu.

223
00:28:05,369 --> 00:28:09,989
Nicola won't stand with us then.
He doesn't want to face Ilhanlı.

224
00:28:10,847 --> 00:28:16,127
Nicola won't hear about this.

225
00:28:27,558 --> 00:28:32,868
Brother, you are responsible for
the security of tents in wedding.

226
00:28:35,437 --> 00:28:40,357
Nicola is looking for a chance to attack.

227
00:28:41,047 --> 00:28:42,639
This is apparent.

228
00:28:42,689 --> 00:28:46,499
- As to Togay...
- That dog loves to raid weddings.

229
00:28:47,802 --> 00:28:51,862
He shed blood in my child's wedding.

230
00:28:52,241 --> 00:28:54,428
He killed my Abdurrahman.

231
00:28:54,428 --> 00:28:58,848
That dog attacks only the women and
children returning from the wedding.

232
00:29:11,030 --> 00:29:13,316
Wait, where are you coming from?

233
00:29:13,316 --> 00:29:15,886
I am from Germiyan.

234
00:29:30,272 --> 00:29:31,962
Are you a messenger?

235
00:29:31,994 --> 00:29:35,314
I am here to fight for Osman Ghazi.

236
00:29:36,461 --> 00:29:38,791
Eyvallah, welcome.

237
00:29:39,268 --> 00:29:40,908
Thank you.

238
00:29:49,626 --> 00:29:52,736
Everybody I encountered mentioned
Domanic

239
00:29:55,271 --> 00:29:58,091
I was there.
It was a great battle.

240
00:30:00,257 --> 00:30:03,277
Osman Bey's brother Savcı Bey
became martyr.

241
00:30:03,418 --> 00:30:06,518
- May he meet heaven.
- Amin.

242
00:30:06,598 --> 00:30:09,948
The bigger a victory is,
the bigger the pain is.

243
00:30:09,985 --> 00:30:14,665
I am here to fight for Osman Bey
as well.

244
00:30:15,999 --> 00:30:18,069
Eyvallah, Eyvallah (Thank you).

245
00:30:20,319 --> 00:30:25,199
Let's ask Osman Bey if he wants
to accept you.

246
00:30:28,428 --> 00:30:30,348
Take his weapon.

247
00:30:37,651 --> 00:30:39,611
What is this for?

248
00:30:45,184 --> 00:30:49,004
- It is a gift for Osman Bey.
- Take it too.

249
00:30:53,105 --> 00:30:54,975
Follow me.

250
00:31:00,086 --> 00:31:05,086
We can set off after the wedding, if
you allow.

251
00:31:05,901 --> 00:31:09,792
We have to see other grasslands
other than Domanic, Osman Bey.

252
00:31:09,792 --> 00:31:13,322
Our tent is getting bigger,
our herds are getting crowded.

253
00:31:14,373 --> 00:31:19,153
We are going to take each land
near Sakarya River...

254
00:31:19,258 --> 00:31:23,388
from Byzantines.

255
00:31:25,051 --> 00:31:32,061
Sakarya river is going to vivify our
tents, our animals inshallah.

256
00:31:33,105 --> 00:31:34,245
Inshallah (if Allah permits).

257
00:31:34,245 --> 00:31:35,735
Can I come in my Bey?

258
00:31:35,922 --> 00:31:37,782
Come.

259
00:31:42,905 --> 00:31:47,275
My Bey, an Alp came from Germiyan.
He wants to see you.

260
00:31:47,883 --> 00:31:49,763
Let him.

261
00:31:53,438 --> 00:31:55,178
Come.

262
00:32:00,316 --> 00:32:03,356
- Welcome.
- Thank you my Bey.

263
00:32:03,892 --> 00:32:07,032
I am coming from Germiyan.

264
00:32:07,425 --> 00:32:10,158
What is the reason for your arrival?

265
00:32:10,158 --> 00:32:17,178
I am Karayeli Muslu Bey's son, but I
want to fight under your flag.

266
00:32:19,360 --> 00:32:24,800
Our order may be heavy for you,
son of a Bey.

267
00:32:27,307 --> 00:32:32,187
Our way ends in battlefield,
we have difficulties.

268
00:32:33,051 --> 00:32:37,598
Turkmen attacks Turkmen
in Anatolia.

269
00:32:37,598 --> 00:32:41,128
Turkmen's sword cuts another
Turkmen.

270
00:32:41,283 --> 00:32:44,752
Who dies is Muslim, who kills is Muslim...

271
00:32:44,752 --> 00:32:48,232
Moreover, the land that conquered
is Muslim too.

272
00:32:48,569 --> 00:32:50,737
You are the real warrior, my Bey.

273
00:32:50,737 --> 00:32:53,807
You are the one who
fights against infidels.

274
00:32:57,909 --> 00:33:01,529
You are telling the truth.

275
00:33:02,002 --> 00:33:06,432
But infidels are not like the enemies
you know.

276
00:33:08,363 --> 00:33:12,443
I have more enemies than friends here.

277
00:33:14,158 --> 00:33:17,488
The best thing for you to think it over,
and come again.

278
00:33:17,941 --> 00:33:23,536
Allow me to die for the flag, reduce the
number of enemy, increase the number of...

279
00:33:23,536 --> 00:33:25,556
our friends, my Bey.

280
00:33:26,578 --> 00:33:31,608
- What is your name? Tell me.
- My name is Turanalp.

281
00:33:32,224 --> 00:33:38,504
My Bey, I heard you'd have a wedding.
if you allow, I have a gift for you.

282
00:33:43,235 --> 00:33:44,915
Bring it!

283
00:34:37,308 --> 00:34:41,528
What do you say, master?

284
00:34:41,673 --> 00:34:44,873
It seems like it is made by a master,
my Bey.

285
00:34:45,187 --> 00:34:48,227
Who did this?

286
00:34:48,290 --> 00:34:51,250
I made it myself for you, my Bey.

287
00:34:51,881 --> 00:34:54,311
I even did the handiwork.

288
00:34:54,379 --> 00:34:56,799
It is made out of Damascus steel.

289
00:34:57,872 --> 00:34:59,602
Eyvallah.

290
00:35:01,057 --> 00:35:03,877
- Goktug.
- My Bey.

291
00:35:04,174 --> 00:35:07,094
He must be travel-sore.
Take care of him.

292
00:35:07,792 --> 00:35:09,622
Of course my Bey.

293
00:35:32,285 --> 00:35:33,795
Brother.

294
00:35:34,348 --> 00:35:38,308
Keep an eye on this Turanalp.

295
00:35:40,598 --> 00:35:44,798
Check Germiyans.

296
00:35:45,681 --> 00:35:47,891
They may have sent a spy...

297
00:35:47,957 --> 00:35:50,327
to observe us.

298
00:35:50,327 --> 00:35:52,657
Don't worry Osman Bey.

299
00:35:55,760 --> 00:35:58,280
- Excuse me Osman Bey.
- Eyvallah (sure).

300
00:36:07,189 --> 00:36:12,529
Osman Bey, I liked that valiant.

301
00:36:16,729 --> 00:36:22,339
Osman Bey, ghazis are gathering under
your flag.

302
00:36:24,205 --> 00:36:26,245
Don't worry.

303
00:36:27,318 --> 00:36:29,128
Inshallah Bamsı Bey.

304
00:36:29,206 --> 00:36:31,266
Inshallah (if Allah permits).

305
00:36:32,529 --> 00:36:39,969
So, Osman Bey, your alps are increasing.
My mad son will cover my absence.

306
00:36:40,060 --> 00:36:43,310
Not at all, no way Bamsı Bey.

307
00:36:45,675 --> 00:36:48,905
No one can fulfill your absence.

308
00:36:51,230 --> 00:36:52,900
I appreciate it.

309
00:36:53,505 --> 00:36:55,515
Eyvallah Osman Bey.

310
00:36:55,723 --> 00:36:57,863
Eyvallah Bamsı Bey.

311
00:37:35,871 --> 00:37:40,251
We'll no longer collect taxes.
It's time to collect heads.

312
00:37:42,567 --> 00:37:46,405
You should have attacked by now.

313
00:37:46,405 --> 00:37:48,845
What hold you back?

314
00:37:49,482 --> 00:37:53,242
Togay freed his soul.

315
00:37:54,648 --> 00:37:57,878
He is waiting for the right
time to attack.

316
00:37:57,991 --> 00:38:00,031
Is that so?

317
00:38:00,171 --> 00:38:04,851
I salute the great soldier who
freed his soul.

318
00:38:08,492 --> 00:38:10,912
What do you want from me?

319
00:38:11,173 --> 00:38:13,233
That you tricked Umur Bey...

320
00:38:13,823 --> 00:38:18,053
made Umur Bey obey Osman Bey.

321
00:38:18,956 --> 00:38:23,306
If you want your fellowship with
Geyhatu to continue...

322
00:38:24,194 --> 00:38:28,654
you'll give me soldiers
when the time comes.

323
00:38:29,805 --> 00:38:33,455
A tasty and bloody price.

324
00:38:35,078 --> 00:38:38,598
What about the taxes you'll take
from my governors?

325
00:38:39,255 --> 00:38:44,625
The gold covered with Turkish blood
and the herds of them will...

326
00:38:45,262 --> 00:38:48,355
make Geyhatu happy enough.

327
00:38:48,355 --> 00:38:55,415
As to you and the other Governors, your
taxes will be paid by Turkmens.

328
00:38:57,995 --> 00:39:04,295
I see the dark souls are combining
our fates.

329
00:39:05,593 --> 00:39:10,483
It is time for Osman to die.

330
00:39:11,071 --> 00:39:15,511
You said you were looking for a chance.
Then...

331
00:39:16,130 --> 00:39:19,660
The wedding shall be a funeral.

332
00:39:22,061 --> 00:39:24,401
Oh, you don't know about it.

333
00:39:25,385 --> 00:39:30,475
Osman is going to make Umur Bey's daughter
his Hatun.

334
00:39:32,158 --> 00:39:34,378
Do you know why?

335
00:39:35,085 --> 00:39:38,035
To kill both of us...

336
00:39:38,164 --> 00:39:40,944
he's making allies.

337
00:39:41,535 --> 00:39:46,295
But you made a right decision
in the right place right time.

338
00:39:46,892 --> 00:39:52,992
Attacking wedding will end this game.

339
00:39:53,713 --> 00:39:59,143
Osman will take precautions in the
wedding. We'll wait for a better chance.

340
00:39:59,106 --> 00:40:03,216
Prepare your soldiers.
Await my word.

341
00:40:03,216 --> 00:40:09,606
I'll find a better opportunity.
Then, we'll get what we want.

342
00:40:38,923 --> 00:40:41,873
Bala.

343
00:40:43,924 --> 00:40:47,154
You look tired.

344
00:40:47,154 --> 00:40:51,904
I am but it was worth it, Osman Bey.
All the preparations are done.

345
00:40:52,029 --> 00:40:56,419
Why are you doing it?
Leave it to someone else.

346
00:40:56,419 --> 00:40:59,739
You are the khatun of this tribe.

347
00:41:00,080 --> 00:41:04,820
We have an important wedding, Osman Bey.
Our bey is marrying.

348
00:41:05,234 --> 00:41:09,234
Of course, the khatun takes care
of things.

349
00:41:09,234 --> 00:41:14,124
I've been sitting idle anyway. I don't
go to jihad or fighting.

350
00:41:16,175 --> 00:41:21,285
I wasn't missed.
Malhun Hatun fought well.

351
00:41:21,902 --> 00:41:25,902
You weren't missed?

352
00:41:27,929 --> 00:41:33,429
When candles extinguish and I see nothing,
when I don't see these pretty eyes...

353
00:41:35,968 --> 00:41:39,968
I remember you.

354
00:41:40,484 --> 00:41:44,984
In my dreams, in battle, in heaven...

355
00:41:45,212 --> 00:41:49,892
I miss you everywhere.

356
00:41:58,629 --> 00:42:05,619
I found everything I was looking for
in you.

357
00:42:17,607 --> 00:42:19,367
Umur Bey's tribe.

358
00:42:19,367 --> 00:42:24,367
So, it's time for farewell, Malhun.

359
00:42:29,063 --> 00:42:33,793
Leader of the Ghazis, Malhun Hatun.

360
00:42:35,958 --> 00:42:40,828
She became a bride and
she is leaving.

361
00:42:44,755 --> 00:42:48,755
From now...

362
00:42:48,755 --> 00:42:52,755
your bey is Osman Bey

363
00:42:53,343 --> 00:42:57,343
And your place is next to him.

364
00:42:58,255 --> 00:43:02,255
Show him the love and respect...

365
00:43:02,255 --> 00:43:06,255
you have shown me.

366
00:43:10,910 --> 00:43:16,630
Don't haste to take your
bey's heart.

367
00:43:17,707 --> 00:43:22,197
Be patient.
Be patient.

368
00:43:30,630 --> 00:43:37,560
May Allah grant you a son, soon.

369
00:43:41,750 --> 00:43:48,030
When Osman Bey hugs the son
he has been waiting for...

370
00:43:48,030 --> 00:43:52,890
his heart will be yours.

371
00:44:12,165 --> 00:44:15,635
Give me your blessing, father.

372
00:44:24,047 --> 00:44:28,047
You always had my blessing...

373
00:44:30,468 --> 00:44:34,468
may Allah bless you too.

374
00:44:35,887 --> 00:44:39,887
You have my blessing.

375
00:44:46,316 --> 00:44:50,316
You have my blessing.

376
00:45:36,500 --> 00:45:39,600
Alright, let him pass.

377
00:46:13,316 --> 00:46:16,686
I apologize. It's necessary.

378
00:46:17,865 --> 00:46:21,865
We have to take caution.

379
00:46:25,848 --> 00:46:29,848
Why don't you look at my eyes?

380
00:46:35,437 --> 00:46:39,927
Pass. I'll find you at the tribe.

381
00:46:49,759 --> 00:46:52,919
You can pass.

382
00:46:52,919 --> 00:46:56,369
Alps, the gate!

383
00:47:42,746 --> 00:47:47,206
May Allah fill your tent with
noises of children.

384
00:47:47,748 --> 00:47:51,748
May Allah grant them a state
to rule.

385
00:47:52,289 --> 00:47:57,459
May Allah give your daughters
worthy children.

386
00:48:00,896 --> 00:48:06,086
May your tent find joy.
May you find happiness, Osman Bey.

387
00:48:57,045 --> 00:48:59,345
Bala.

388
00:49:01,249 --> 00:49:03,459
Bala.

389
00:49:04,609 --> 00:49:08,609
I know your love for me.

390
00:49:08,609 --> 00:49:14,969
Tonight and many nights
I will grin and bear it.

391
00:49:18,090 --> 00:49:22,440
Know that I accept it because of
my love for you.

392
00:50:50,551 --> 00:50:54,231
May Allah give you a happy marriage.

393
00:50:56,340 --> 00:51:00,160
May Allah give you happiness.

394
00:51:35,488 --> 00:51:41,458
The wedding processional is coming!
The wedding processional is coming!

395
00:51:42,593 --> 00:51:47,983
The wedding processional is coming!
The wedding processional is coming!

396
00:54:34,690 --> 00:54:40,130
It's time for you to take your escrow
in Allah's presence.

397
00:54:42,732 --> 00:54:46,732
Alright, my sheik.
Alright.

398
00:55:48,389 --> 00:55:51,969
May you prosper, Malhun Hatun!

399
00:55:59,578 --> 00:56:03,578
May you prosper, Malhun Hatun!

400
00:56:17,069 --> 00:56:21,989
-Welcome!
-Thank you.

401
00:56:24,756 --> 00:56:28,196
Come.

402
00:56:35,015 --> 00:56:40,395
Let's perform the ceremony with the
witnessing of Bamsı and Davut Beys.

403
00:56:40,395 --> 00:56:43,235
Of course, my sheik.

404
00:56:48,749 --> 00:56:52,749
Come, my sheik.
Umur Bey.

405
00:57:25,420 --> 00:57:30,860
Here are the heads of those who
betrayed you, Togay. All are dead.

406
00:57:30,860 --> 00:57:33,920
No one is left to take any news
to Yargucu.

407
00:57:33,920 --> 00:57:38,860
Make sheaths for my warriors
from their skins.

408
00:57:38,860 --> 00:57:43,680
They'll remember Genghis Khan's laws
as they look at them.

409
00:57:49,573 --> 00:57:54,823
Let me give you a better gift
than their bodies, Togay.

410
00:57:55,142 --> 00:57:59,842
Osman will take his herds
to the uplands.

411
00:57:59,842 --> 00:58:03,842
They'll migrate, to Domaniç.

412
00:58:03,842 --> 00:58:08,362
Here is the opportunity
I was waiting for.

413
00:58:09,508 --> 00:58:13,508
Domaniç...
While Osman...

414
00:58:14,506 --> 00:58:19,556
is having joy at his wedding...

415
00:58:20,456 --> 00:58:25,216
Domaniç will be the grave of the Kayı.

416
00:58:37,919 --> 00:58:43,639
Malhun, daughter of Umur Bey,
do you accept...

417
00:58:43,639 --> 00:58:49,469
Osman Bey, son of Ertuğrul Ghazi
as your husband...

418
00:58:49,469 --> 00:58:54,009
for 1000 dram of gold and
200 sheep of dowry?

419
00:59:02,167 --> 00:59:05,557
I do.

420
00:59:06,011 --> 00:59:11,901
-Do you?
-I do.

421
00:59:15,478 --> 00:59:20,978
Son of Ertuğrul Ghazi and
Halime Hatun, Osman...

422
00:59:21,286 --> 00:59:26,486
do you accept Umur Bey's
daughter Malhun...

423
00:59:26,486 --> 00:59:31,806
with the dowry you accepted to pay?
-I do.

424
00:59:32,994 --> 00:59:40,354
-Do you?
-I do.

425
00:59:43,594 --> 00:59:47,734
Witnesses!
Have you witnessed it?

426
00:59:47,734 --> 00:59:51,614
-We have.
-We have.

427
00:59:51,614 --> 00:59:56,234
May Allah bless your marriage.

428
00:59:56,234 --> 01:00:00,234
Amin. Amin.

429
01:00:00,491 --> 01:00:02,881
Amin.

430
01:00:04,296 --> 01:00:06,006
My Allah...

431
01:00:06,006 --> 01:00:12,466
we witnessed the marriage
of these two subjects of yours.

432
01:00:13,282 --> 01:00:16,312
You witness it too.

433
01:00:16,942 --> 01:00:20,512
-Amin.
-Amin.

434
01:00:20,512 --> 01:00:26,582
My Allah, bless this marriage.

435
01:00:26,582 --> 01:00:31,342
-Amin.
-Among these two...

436
01:00:31,342 --> 01:00:35,342
let there be harmony...

437
01:00:35,342 --> 01:00:40,482
love and peace.
-Amin.

438
01:00:41,065 --> 01:00:46,355
Let there be no hatred, discord...

439
01:00:46,355 --> 01:00:50,735
or seperation.
-Amin.

440
01:00:50,735 --> 01:00:53,165
My Allah...

441
01:00:53,165 --> 01:00:58,735
give them worthy children...

442
01:00:58,735 --> 01:01:03,695
long lives and prosperity.
-Amin.

443
01:01:03,695 --> 01:01:09,195
Amin.
-Al-fatehah!

444
01:01:48,609 --> 01:01:52,609
Welcome!
Welcome, Ayşe Hatun!

445
01:02:02,884 --> 01:02:06,884
-Ayşe...
-Gündüz!

446
01:02:15,348 --> 01:02:19,528
It's been a long while, Ayşe.
Welcome.

447
01:02:19,528 --> 01:02:24,088
I saw you now.
I can happily die now.

448
01:02:26,999 --> 01:02:30,999
-Inshallah you saw my son too.
-Of course, I did.

449
01:02:30,999 --> 01:02:35,799
I went to Germiyan lands.
He was at the madrasah.

450
01:02:35,799 --> 01:02:41,349
He counts days to come to the tribe
and become an alp.

451
01:02:41,349 --> 01:02:46,429
He will be, of course. He will be.

452
01:02:46,429 --> 01:02:50,429
But firstly, he will finish his
education.

453
01:02:54,119 --> 01:02:58,119
I should help the women.

454
01:02:58,438 --> 01:03:01,658
Come on.

455
01:03:08,967 --> 01:03:12,967
Welcome, Ayşe Hatun!
Welcome.

456
01:06:36,590 --> 01:06:40,590
When he became 20...

457
01:06:41,005 --> 01:06:45,005
his cause got blessed!

458
01:06:45,374 --> 01:06:49,374
Upon all the tyrants...

459
01:06:50,156 --> 01:06:54,426
he is like a hidden giant, Osman Bey!

460
01:06:54,750 --> 01:06:59,190
The student of Sheik Edebali!

461
01:06:59,826 --> 01:07:04,186
May the lands of the heathen
get cursed!

462
01:07:04,668 --> 01:07:08,668
The pride of Ertuğrul Ghazi!

463
01:07:09,055 --> 01:07:13,275
Osman Bey is a special valiant!

464
01:07:19,215 --> 01:07:23,215
He subjugated many nations!

465
01:07:26,048 --> 01:07:30,598
He is the bravest of all!

466
01:07:30,777 --> 01:07:34,777
He strokes his claws at the tyrants...

467
01:07:34,777 --> 01:07:39,647
like a black wolf, Osman Bey!

468
01:07:40,209 --> 01:07:44,209
He strokes his claws at the tyrants...

469
01:07:44,706 --> 01:07:48,896
like a black wolf, Osman Bey!

470
01:08:08,628 --> 01:08:12,628
With strong horses of
gray hair...

471
01:08:12,893 --> 01:08:16,893
with well-made weapons...

472
01:08:18,188 --> 01:08:22,188
with bold alps...

473
01:08:22,471 --> 01:08:26,471
he wrote a legend, Osman Bey!

474
01:08:27,602 --> 01:08:31,602
While the oppressed were
crying...

475
01:08:32,011 --> 01:08:36,011
his heart ripped from chest...

476
01:08:36,926 --> 01:08:40,926
he ventured forth for them...

477
01:08:41,677 --> 01:08:45,677
to be their shelter like
a great tent!

478
01:08:51,176 --> 01:08:55,176
He subjugated many nations!

479
01:08:58,244 --> 01:09:02,244
He is the bravest of all!

480
01:09:03,199 --> 01:09:07,199
He strokes his claws at the tyrants...

481
01:09:07,862 --> 01:09:11,862
like a black wolf, Osman Bey!

482
01:09:12,611 --> 01:09:16,611
He strokes his claws at the tyrants...

483
01:09:17,478 --> 01:09:21,478
like a black wolf, Osman Bey!

484
01:09:31,723 --> 01:09:38,423
Mashallah!
Mashallah!

485
01:09:46,124 --> 01:09:50,124
As my sheik father says...

486
01:09:51,156 --> 01:09:55,156
this is the test I must endure.

487
01:10:43,748 --> 01:10:50,488
Our sultan didn't send me only to
celebrate your marriage.

488
01:10:50,488 --> 01:10:55,288
He knows about Togay.
Your agreement must stand.

489
01:10:57,503 --> 01:11:00,953
Our sultan shouldn't worry.

490
01:11:01,470 --> 01:11:06,670
We'll keep acting like the
vassals of Ilkhaganete.

491
01:11:08,060 --> 01:11:13,390
If our sultan is gathering an army from
Konya, it's the value he is giving you.

492
01:11:16,451 --> 01:11:22,571
The honorable banner of the Kayı
awaits the soldiers of our sultan.

493
01:11:25,435 --> 01:11:30,875
Now, Kızılbeyoğulları too...

494
01:11:30,875 --> 01:11:35,545
will fight under the banner of Kayı.

495
01:11:38,838 --> 01:11:44,578
Soon! Soon! The subjugation of
the Turks is coming to an end!

496
01:11:44,578 --> 01:11:50,528
Both the Byzantine lord and
the Mongols will kneel!

497
01:11:51,018 --> 01:11:55,633
May Allah let me see those days.

498
01:11:55,633 --> 01:11:58,333
Amin! Amin!

499
01:11:58,333 --> 01:12:03,003
May those days come soon, Bamsı Bey!

500
01:12:03,454 --> 01:12:08,434
Isn't it enough that Muslims suffered?

501
01:12:09,659 --> 01:12:12,849
Kumral Abdal, thank you.

502
01:12:12,859 --> 01:12:18,059
May Allah give prosperity to you
and to your lineage, Osman Bey.

503
01:12:18,059 --> 01:12:20,299
Thank you.

504
01:12:21,038 --> 01:12:24,578
-Amin.
-Amin.

505
01:12:56,841 --> 01:13:00,841
-You are so beautiful, Malhun Hatun.
-Thank you, pretty girl.

506
01:13:05,559 --> 01:13:09,629
I wish we could see Lena too.

507
01:13:09,662 --> 01:13:13,662
-Inshallah we'll meet soon.
-Inshallah.

508
01:13:16,540 --> 01:13:20,540
Gonca Hatun, where is Bala Hatun?

509
01:13:23,547 --> 01:13:26,617
At her tent.

510
01:14:06,515 --> 01:14:12,585
-What did Osman Bey do?
-He had fought the heathens!

511
01:14:16,912 --> 01:14:20,854
What did he do for Malhun Hatun?

512
01:14:20,854 --> 01:14:26,214
He had helped the ones in need!

513
01:14:30,084 --> 01:14:33,524
Did he break hearts?

514
01:14:34,192 --> 01:14:41,282
Neither did he do that, nor did he speak
any ill words. He married Malhun Hatun!

515
01:14:58,827 --> 01:15:05,117
-Then, may Allah make them happy!
-Amin!

516
01:15:05,117 --> 01:15:09,117
May you be happy for a lifetime!

517
01:17:31,508 --> 01:17:34,768
If you allow me.

518
01:18:52,594 --> 01:18:59,204
May our tent find joy with our
sons and daughters.

519
01:19:01,958 --> 01:19:05,958
May your happiness last forever,
Malhun Hatun.

520
01:19:54,019 --> 01:20:01,199
My Allah, help me control the
fir in my heart.

521
01:20:02,270 --> 01:20:06,270
Give Osman Bey a child.

522
01:20:06,270 --> 01:20:10,730
Give him children that are worthy
to his state.

523
01:20:11,741 --> 01:20:15,001
Amin.

524
01:20:38,602 --> 01:20:43,122
Thanks Gündüz Bey. He did the
most of the job.

525
01:20:43,122 --> 01:20:47,122
It's our job to take care of the
women and the children.

526
01:20:48,230 --> 01:20:53,270
-I'm asking tent by tent.
-May Allah bless you.

527
01:20:53,270 --> 01:20:57,270
The foodbank at Söğük shouldn't
hinder.

528
01:20:57,270 --> 01:21:01,000
They shouldn't be left alone
because we'll be at the upland.

529
01:21:01,000 --> 01:21:06,380
I took care of it personally. The poor
people won't realize our absence.

530
01:21:06,770 --> 01:21:11,330
-The food will be distributed.
-Good. Mashallah.

531
01:21:29,767 --> 01:21:32,717
Welcome, Malhun Hatun.

532
01:21:35,054 --> 01:21:38,734
Welcome!
Welcome!

533
01:21:38,734 --> 01:21:42,404
Power to your elbows, women!

534
01:21:46,111 --> 01:21:49,781
Welcome to our tribe, Malhun Hatun.

535
01:21:56,540 --> 01:22:01,070
-Good day, Bala Hatun.
-Thank you, Malhun Hatun.

536
01:22:01,070 --> 01:22:04,520
Come.

537
01:22:13,920 --> 01:22:18,130
Mashallah, everyone is working like
bees.

538
01:22:19,731 --> 01:22:25,991
-The migration caravan is already ready.
-It's handled quickly when it's parted well.

539
01:22:29,961 --> 01:22:32,761
We should help.

540
01:22:32,761 --> 01:22:36,761
Maybe there are families who
hasn't finished preperations.

541
01:22:36,761 --> 01:22:40,091
We can provide mounts and stuff.

542
01:22:40,453 --> 01:22:45,363
Don't worry, Malhun Hatun. There are no
people in need at Kayı Tribe.

543
01:23:19,255 --> 01:23:23,255
-Osman Bey!
-Where were you...

544
01:23:23,255 --> 01:23:27,835
when Nikola was killing innocent people,
soaking your lands in blood, Lord Leo?

545
01:23:28,313 --> 01:23:34,583
I was in Macedonia. these happenings
disturbed me deeply, Osman Bey.

546
01:23:34,929 --> 01:23:40,279
I want you to know that I don't approve
what Nikola and the emperor did.

547
01:23:40,991 --> 01:23:45,491
I couldn't attend the wedding.

548
01:23:45,491 --> 01:23:50,488
But I want you to accept my gifts for
you and Malhun Hatun.

549
01:23:55,366 --> 01:23:59,566
I know that you are from the house
of Laskaris.

550
01:24:00,536 --> 01:24:07,246
Everyone knows the animosity between
you and the emperor.

551
01:24:08,409 --> 01:24:13,149
Your visitation here, the gifts
you brought...

552
01:24:13,149 --> 01:24:18,389
the hand of peace that you extend,
I'm afraid they might be your end.

553
01:24:19,547 --> 01:24:23,757
If I was afraid of my end,
I wouldn't be here.

554
01:24:23,757 --> 01:24:29,717
My only fear is that Nikola will
end us all, Osman Bey.

555
01:24:32,908 --> 01:24:39,528
By the way, I want you to know that
I won't kneel to Nikola's oppression.

556
01:24:41,009 --> 01:24:45,009
Nikola acts like he bows to Togay.

557
01:24:45,009 --> 01:24:49,609
His real intention is to weaken you.

558
01:24:49,884 --> 01:24:55,604
But what he doesn't know,
or what he doesn't want to know...

559
01:24:56,089 --> 01:25:00,839
-What is it?
-If he let's the Mongols oppress you...

560
01:25:00,839 --> 01:25:06,269
it will be our turn then. He is playing
with the devil to stop you.

561
01:25:07,804 --> 01:25:11,751
Nikola is a man who lost his way.

562
01:25:11,751 --> 01:25:16,371
Our way is the way of peace
of your father Ertuğrul Ghazi.

563
01:25:16,703 --> 01:25:21,603
Otherwise, it will be the end of us all..

564
01:25:26,688 --> 01:25:31,988
Then, let's strengthen our friendship,
Lord Leo.

565
01:25:31,988 --> 01:25:35,988
I'm ready to hold the hand you
extend for friendship.

566
01:25:37,000 --> 01:25:41,490
Then, it's time to move to
the upland, Lord Leo.

567
01:25:41,622 --> 01:25:45,742
As it was in your father Ertuğrul Ghazi's
time...

568
01:25:45,742 --> 01:25:51,572
I'm ready to hold the valuable things
escrow at my castle.

569
01:26:09,315 --> 01:26:13,835
-What is that, Alaca?
-A Rum girl named Zoe.

570
01:26:13,835 --> 01:26:18,545
She has no one. She came from Söğüt
to help the preperations.

571
01:26:18,805 --> 01:26:23,145
-So? -We talked a bit.
She gave it to me while leaving.

572
01:26:24,277 --> 01:26:29,267
She made it herself. She said that it
looked good on me. Then she left.

573
01:26:29,899 --> 01:26:35,249
A girl all alone, huh?
She is very talented.

574
01:26:35,249 --> 01:26:39,249
Look how pretty she made it.

575
01:26:39,249 --> 01:26:44,359
Talented seems little of a word.
She cooked, took care of the baby...

576
01:26:44,359 --> 01:26:47,529
turned and tidied everything.

577
01:26:47,529 --> 01:26:51,529
She put more effort into my wedding
than you, it seems.

578
01:26:56,410 --> 01:27:00,780
-Alaca?
-What's on your mind, Malhun Hatun?

579
01:27:00,780 --> 01:27:05,650
If Osman Bey sees it fitting, I want
Zoe in my service.

580
01:27:14,853 --> 01:27:20,043
Our watchman have located to see
anything that happens in Byzantine forts.

581
01:27:20,744 --> 01:27:24,744
Our alps will follow the migration
caravan, step by step.

582
01:27:24,744 --> 01:27:29,604
-And they'll keep you informed.
-Thank you, brother. Thank you.

583
01:27:29,604 --> 01:27:34,604
Our tents are ready for the upland,
my bey. They left before sunrise.

584
01:27:34,604 --> 01:27:38,674
When the caravan reaches there, the
tents will be set.

585
01:27:38,674 --> 01:27:43,784
Davud Bey set his smithry
at the upland, Osman Bey.

586
01:27:44,267 --> 01:27:48,267
Now, our alps won't have to...

587
01:27:48,267 --> 01:27:52,627
come to the tribe for horseshoes
or broken weapons.

588
01:27:54,488 --> 01:27:58,488
Leo, the lord of Bilecik...

589
01:27:58,488 --> 01:28:02,978
accepted to hold our stuff
for us while we migrate.

590
01:28:04,494 --> 01:28:08,494
Osman Bey, this is good.
It's good, but...

591
01:28:08,494 --> 01:28:12,494
I don't know. When Nikola
was so crazy...

592
01:28:12,740 --> 01:28:18,570
Leo was our friend during Ertuğrul Ghazi's
time, but...

593
01:28:18,570 --> 01:28:22,570
In these lands,
friendship is like a mad wind...

594
01:28:22,570 --> 01:28:26,570
that no one knows which way it will blow.

595
01:28:27,002 --> 01:28:31,492
You are right, Osman Bey.
You are right.

596
01:28:31,492 --> 01:28:36,853
We are nomads but we make the lands
ours, sooner or later.

597
01:28:37,347 --> 01:28:41,347
If Lord Leo's intentions aren't pure...

598
01:28:41,347 --> 01:28:44,677
he'll end up dead.

599
01:28:44,677 --> 01:28:50,027
We'll see, Bamsı Bey.
Lord Leo wants...

600
01:28:50,923 --> 01:28:56,333
to stay a friend to me as he was to my
father. We will see...

601
01:28:56,933 --> 01:29:00,663
if he is a man of his word.

602
01:29:06,981 --> 01:29:12,041
You brought the burning heat
of Karakurum deserts to my room, Togay.

603
01:29:12,424 --> 01:29:16,184
I welcome your wrath.

604
01:29:16,409 --> 01:29:22,349
You remind me of the sweet yeast breads
that my mother used to make me.

605
01:29:22,349 --> 01:29:26,349
You are different at every moment.

606
01:29:26,847 --> 01:29:31,577
You brought the silence of the desert too.

607
01:29:35,247 --> 01:29:40,787
Geyhatu's hunting dog got a smell.

608
01:29:44,509 --> 01:29:48,509
Is your prey big?

609
01:30:07,396 --> 01:30:14,626
Kayı Tribe will migrate to
Domaniç Uplands.

610
01:30:15,127 --> 01:30:17,927
The road to the upland...

611
01:30:19,549 --> 01:30:25,069
will turn into a blood river.
-So, you got your opportunity?

612
01:30:25,152 --> 01:30:30,352
A prey worthy of a hunting dog
such as you.

613
01:30:31,001 --> 01:30:34,051
What do you want from me, Togay?

614
01:30:34,051 --> 01:30:39,441
Give me your best soldiers,
your best archers.

615
01:30:41,371 --> 01:30:44,361
No.

616
01:30:45,952 --> 01:30:50,762
Is not an appropriate answer
for this offer.

617
01:30:52,191 --> 01:30:56,841
They are all ready. When?

618
01:30:56,841 --> 01:30:59,181
Tomorrow.

619
01:32:00,988 --> 01:32:03,918
Welcome, my bey.

620
01:32:04,565 --> 01:32:09,475
-Thank you. Thank you.
-Come.

621
01:32:22,805 --> 01:32:25,745
You too.

622
01:32:31,301 --> 01:32:34,601
Let's go.

623
01:32:36,454 --> 01:32:40,134
With the name of Allah.

624
01:32:45,149 --> 01:32:49,569
You said you liked it before.
I made it again.

625
01:33:02,167 --> 01:33:05,177
You should eat too.

626
01:35:43,127 --> 01:35:46,777
Allah bless your hands.

627
01:35:48,929 --> 01:35:52,289
Thank you, Osman Bey.

628
01:35:55,004 --> 01:35:59,474
So, tel me.
How was your first day.

629
01:35:59,474 --> 01:36:01,734
Will you get used to here?

630
01:36:03,345 --> 01:36:08,365
Our customs are the same, Osman Bey.
It won't take long.

631
01:36:08,365 --> 01:36:11,785
Inshallah, the women of the tribe
will get used to me as well.

632
01:36:11,785 --> 01:36:16,485
Inshallah. Inshallah, they will.

633
01:36:22,127 --> 01:36:25,327
They will.

634
01:36:42,621 --> 01:36:46,621
It looks like you want fresh air,
Osman Bey.

635
01:36:46,621 --> 01:36:51,071
You are welcome here.
You shared my bread.

636
01:36:51,071 --> 01:36:55,831
If you want to leave now,
I don't want to force you here.

637
01:36:56,608 --> 01:37:00,608
What are you saying, Malhun Hatun?

638
01:37:00,608 --> 01:37:04,608
Why would I be forced to stay here?

639
01:37:04,608 --> 01:37:08,608
Even though this marriage was to
unite two tribes...

640
01:37:09,582 --> 01:37:13,262
at the end, it is done.

641
01:37:13,320 --> 01:37:19,170
Now, we are wife and husband.

642
01:37:22,925 --> 01:37:28,725
That's what I'm saying. The interests
of the two tribes are satisfied.

643
01:37:29,171 --> 01:37:34,291
This marriage isn't only built on the
interests of two tribes.

644
01:37:35,836 --> 01:37:38,886
What is it then?

645
01:37:40,361 --> 01:37:43,691
Kayı Tribe...

646
01:37:46,598 --> 01:37:50,308
found what fits it.

647
01:38:10,172 --> 01:38:16,322
My food is ready, face is smiling,
and tent is warm...

648
01:38:16,322 --> 01:38:21,282
whenever you visit here.

649
01:38:21,282 --> 01:38:24,822
Come whenever you want, Osman Bey.

650
01:38:45,362 --> 01:38:48,862
Malhun Hatun.

651
01:39:04,615 --> 01:39:08,185
Good night.

652
01:39:11,778 --> 01:39:14,928
Good night.

653
01:40:25,275 --> 01:40:27,505
Bala.

654
01:40:35,475 --> 01:40:40,525
Tell me. What keeps you out of your
tent at this hour?

655
01:40:40,857 --> 01:40:45,507
It was warm inside. I needed
some air.

656
01:40:52,048 --> 01:40:56,588
-If so...
-What about you?

657
01:40:59,262 --> 01:41:02,732
Why aren't you in your tent?

658
01:41:05,332 --> 01:41:08,072
What do you think?

659
01:41:14,386 --> 01:41:18,386
Now, we'll have such days, Osman Bey.

660
01:41:20,234 --> 01:41:26,444
In the same tribe, in such close
tents...

661
01:41:26,444 --> 01:41:30,444
but seperated.
I'll be alone...

662
01:41:31,009 --> 01:41:35,009
and you'll--
-Be with your dream.

663
01:41:37,585 --> 01:41:42,035
When did I ever tell you a lie, Bala?
When?

664
01:41:43,212 --> 01:41:48,022
When did I ever betray your love?

665
01:43:00,593 --> 01:43:04,593
Mashallah, shepherd leader.

666
01:43:04,593 --> 01:43:08,593
Now, the sounds of our animals and
our carts...

667
01:43:08,593 --> 01:43:13,123
will take over the green uplands.
Godspeed.

668
01:43:15,722 --> 01:43:19,722
Mashallah. Gencebey!

669
01:43:19,722 --> 01:43:24,662
You'll protect our right wing. Saltuk,
you'll protect our left wing.

670
01:43:24,662 --> 01:43:30,042
-We'll be your wings and fly like birds.
-Thank you, Saltuk. I know.

671
01:43:31,283 --> 01:43:36,713
Aygül, my girl. How are our women?
Do they need anything?

672
01:43:36,713 --> 01:43:42,123
Everything is ready, my bey.
We prepared everything.

673
01:43:43,086 --> 01:43:47,086
The supplies are all loaded.

674
01:43:47,086 --> 01:43:50,496
We also keep the water cold.

675
01:43:50,496 --> 01:43:55,086
Good. Good. Mashallah to my child.
But...

676
01:43:55,086 --> 01:43:58,296
are the women ready?
We don't know what might happen.

677
01:43:58,296 --> 01:44:03,256
They are all armed, my bey.
They are masters now. Don't worry.

678
01:44:04,551 --> 01:44:10,491
Now, we should be on our way.

679
01:44:10,491 --> 01:44:14,811
Now, our destination is the uplands.
May Allah open our ways.

680
01:44:14,811 --> 01:44:18,811
Amin.
Amin.

681
01:44:18,811 --> 01:44:23,421
My bey, I had some meal prepared
for you.

682
01:44:24,693 --> 01:44:29,423
I have some halvah too.

683
01:44:29,860 --> 01:44:34,250
Come on, my child.
I see what's Cerkutay getting at.

684
01:44:34,489 --> 01:44:38,489
You'll leave me hungry again, huh?

685
01:44:39,039 --> 01:44:43,039
Come on! Come on! Come on!

686
01:44:44,046 --> 01:44:48,046
Mashallah. Mashallah, my dear ones.

687
01:45:03,823 --> 01:45:07,823
Caravan leader, is your caravan ready?

688
01:45:10,494 --> 01:45:15,014
May Hz.Hızır accompany us.
We are ready, Osman Bey.

689
01:45:15,014 --> 01:45:18,544
Mashallah, mashallah.

690
01:45:19,049 --> 01:45:23,449
Bala Hatun, I choose...

691
01:45:23,449 --> 01:45:28,209
Aygül Hatun as the she-leader of
the caravan.

692
01:45:53,868 --> 01:45:59,098
She-leader of the caravan, Aygül Hatun.

693
01:45:59,098 --> 01:46:03,918
May your days as a maiden end.

694
01:46:03,918 --> 01:46:08,308
May you find an appropriate husband.

695
01:46:08,942 --> 01:46:11,902
Thank you, Bala Hatun.

696
01:46:26,777 --> 01:46:32,927
Osman Bey, when I look at you,
I see Ertuğrul Bey.

697
01:46:36,678 --> 01:46:42,508
Good old days. We set many caravans
on these roads.

698
01:46:42,997 --> 01:46:47,897
We saw many springs together.

699
01:46:48,543 --> 01:46:53,623
Bamsı Bey, you never let me feel the
absence of my father.

700
01:46:53,623 --> 01:46:58,083
You were his blood brother and
his companion.

701
01:46:59,382 --> 01:47:05,662
If we see this beautiful spring,
it's because of you and our martyrs.

702
01:47:06,460 --> 01:47:10,460
Thank you. But...

703
01:47:10,460 --> 01:47:14,460
our time has passed.

704
01:47:14,460 --> 01:47:22,570
Death is coming after me to unite me
with Ertuğrul Bey.

705
01:47:24,898 --> 01:47:30,788
But, Osman Bey, you are the
future of the Turks.

706
01:47:30,788 --> 01:47:37,618
May the Turkish tribes unite under
your leadership.

707
01:47:37,618 --> 01:47:40,558
Inshallah, Bamsı Bey.

708
01:47:40,818 --> 01:47:44,818
Inshallah. Now...

709
01:47:44,818 --> 01:47:49,248
may our herds grow in number.
May Hz.Hızır accompany you on the road.

710
01:47:49,248 --> 01:47:53,048
Amin. Amin, Osman Bey.

711
01:47:53,145 --> 01:47:56,165
Mashallah!

712
01:48:00,306 --> 01:48:04,306
-Godspeed. May Allah guide you.
-Thank you.

713
01:48:04,306 --> 01:48:08,306
Thank you, my dear ones.
Thank you.

714
01:48:09,898 --> 01:48:13,898
Let's go now.

715
01:48:22,503 --> 01:48:27,203
Let's go now. We are going
to the uplands.

716
01:48:27,377 --> 01:48:31,827
We are going to the uplands!

717
01:48:42,563 --> 01:48:46,563
My bey, if you allow me, I want
to go with them.

718
01:48:46,563 --> 01:48:50,943
-Go and accompany Bamsı Bey.
-Thank you, my bey.

719
01:48:50,943 --> 01:48:53,393
May Allah clear your way.

720
01:49:11,061 --> 01:49:13,681
-Boran.
-Yes, my bey.

721
01:49:13,681 --> 01:49:17,511
Ready my horse. I'll visit my sheik.

722
01:49:17,511 --> 01:49:20,261
As you order, my bey.

723
01:49:36,029 --> 01:49:40,029
Everyone writes their own destiny.

724
01:49:40,187 --> 01:49:44,187
We'll write the fate of these lands
together.

725
01:49:44,187 --> 01:49:48,187
You, in the name of Genghis Khan's laws,
and I, in the name of the empire.

726
01:49:48,429 --> 01:49:51,339
For our alliance.

727
01:49:54,214 --> 01:49:59,844
I only ally with death.

728
01:49:59,844 --> 01:50:05,204
I'll water the uplands of Domaniç
for the honor of death.

729
01:50:07,239 --> 01:50:12,509
There is a great army waiting for
you outside.

730
01:50:12,509 --> 01:50:18,299
My soldiers and commanders will
be in your order.

731
01:50:18,484 --> 01:50:24,194
I can't wait to decorate my walls with
the skulls you will bring.

732
01:50:45,800 --> 01:50:51,810
For the dark oath...

733
01:50:51,903 --> 01:50:59,813
for the soils that are watered
with the lust of death...

734
01:51:00,200 --> 01:51:03,380
in Genghis Khan's path...

735
01:51:03,380 --> 01:51:08,770
may death honor us all!

736
01:51:09,303 --> 01:51:14,873
For Genghiz Khan!
For Genghiz Khan!

737
01:51:16,800 --> 01:51:21,790
May your saints lead you to victory!

738
01:51:22,046 --> 01:51:27,499
To victory!
To victory!

739
01:51:34,944 --> 01:51:39,234
This is the end of Osman Bey.

740
01:51:39,559 --> 01:51:43,559
The sleeping devil has awakened, Helen.

741
01:51:43,696 --> 01:51:49,276
Now, it's time for Osman's death.

742
01:51:56,270 --> 01:52:01,260
What about these perfumeries? Shouldn't
they be on the entrance?

743
01:52:01,260 --> 01:52:05,580
Right. Good smells should greet
the people.

744
01:52:05,973 --> 01:52:12,443
My sheik, what do you think? We should
talk to the ahi guild too.

745
01:52:12,443 --> 01:52:18,423
I want everyone to approve the development
of this marketplace.

746
01:52:18,423 --> 01:52:25,883
This is the right thing, Osman Bey. It's
the merchants and the people who'll use it.

747
01:52:26,280 --> 01:52:30,920
-What's important is what they want.
-Of course. Of course.

748
01:52:31,102 --> 01:52:36,662
Osman Bey, we need to move the butchers
to this side of the marketplace.

749
01:52:44,274 --> 01:52:49,654
My sheik, this building looks fitting
for a pavilion.

750
01:52:49,764 --> 01:52:53,764
It's fitting, Osman Bey.

751
01:52:53,764 --> 01:52:59,884
The marketplace isn't just a trading
place. It should need everything...

752
01:52:59,884 --> 01:53:03,854
gardens and bathhouses too.
-Of course, my sheik.

753
01:53:04,091 --> 01:53:09,221
-Who owns this building?
-We'll find out right away, my bey.

754
01:53:19,767 --> 01:53:23,767
You will know who owns what here...

755
01:53:23,767 --> 01:53:28,457
Muslims and non-Muslims. Everything.

756
01:53:29,943 --> 01:53:34,863
-Now find me the owner.
-As you order, my bey.

757
01:53:37,331 --> 01:53:40,441
My sheik.

758
01:54:02,016 --> 01:54:04,906
Come on, my dear ones.

759
01:54:32,226 --> 01:54:35,806
Come on, my dear ones!

760
01:54:35,806 --> 01:54:38,356
Come on, my valiants!

761
01:54:53,855 --> 01:54:57,115
Mashallah! Come on!

762
01:55:01,495 --> 01:55:03,875
Come on!

763
01:55:28,794 --> 01:55:32,504
How is the migration going, Osman Bey?

764
01:55:33,211 --> 01:55:38,161
-The first caravan departed to Domaniç.
-Mashallah.

765
01:55:38,161 --> 01:55:42,811
-Inshallah, they'll arrive safely.
-Inshallah, my sheik. Inshallah.

766
01:55:43,957 --> 01:55:47,567
And about that building.

767
01:55:47,851 --> 01:55:52,241
I've no doubt that your decision
will be just.

768
01:55:52,241 --> 01:55:57,211
The real development of Söğüt
will be with justice.

769
01:56:02,093 --> 01:56:06,663
My bey, my sheik.
The owner of the building.

770
01:56:09,061 --> 01:56:12,861
-Welcome.
-Thank you, my bey.

771
01:56:12,861 --> 01:56:16,751
If you allow me, my sheik.
Come, sit.

772
01:56:17,133 --> 01:56:21,193
Osman Bey, you are the ruler of Söğüt.
How can I sit next to you?

773
01:56:21,193 --> 01:56:25,493
Not at all. Not at all.
Come, sit.

774
01:56:32,080 --> 01:56:37,020
Now, I'm a buyer who wants
your building.

775
01:56:37,020 --> 01:56:43,550
But let's keep our titles aside.
So that our trade can be fair.

776
01:56:43,550 --> 01:56:50,250
You shouldn't be forced to make an
unwanted decision via fear.

777
01:56:50,250 --> 01:56:52,610
I'm grateful, my Allah.

778
01:56:52,610 --> 01:56:56,610
Now, I want your building.
What is it's worth?

779
01:56:58,956 --> 01:57:04,186
Be at ease. Tell what it's worth.

780
01:57:06,967 --> 01:57:11,827
It has no value. Because I don't
want to sell it.

781
01:57:24,759 --> 01:57:29,749
If you don't want to sell it,
then...

782
01:57:29,749 --> 01:57:35,949
there is nothing to say.
You can leave freely.

783
01:57:38,206 --> 01:57:43,656
It's true that you are just, Osman Bey.
May God bless your beylig.

784
01:57:46,585 --> 01:57:49,085
Amin.

785
01:57:51,147 --> 01:57:58,087
This justice you show to Allah's subjects
with no discrimination...

786
01:57:58,284 --> 01:58:02,284
may it pass to your children.

787
01:58:02,284 --> 01:58:06,284
May your beylig turn into a state.

788
01:58:06,284 --> 01:58:10,643
May Muslims and non-Muslims...

789
01:58:10,643 --> 01:58:15,403
find peace and security under
this flag.

790
01:58:18,998 --> 01:58:25,198
Inshallah, my sheik.
Inshallah.

791
01:58:54,360 --> 01:58:58,140
Osman Bey isn't here, Togay.

792
01:58:58,140 --> 01:59:00,960
Who is leading them?

793
01:59:05,415 --> 01:59:08,755
Bamsı Bey.

794
01:59:38,192 --> 01:59:40,662
My bey!

795
01:59:43,040 --> 01:59:48,990
-What's wrong, Baysungur?
-My bey, Togay! He left Nikola's castle.

796
01:59:49,435 --> 01:59:55,325
-What about Nikola?
-Togay is leading soldiers and warriors.

797
01:59:58,157 --> 02:00:03,887
-Do you know where they'll go?
-We have, my bey. To Domaniç uplands.

798
02:00:03,887 --> 02:00:08,617
What are you saying? Alps! Inform
the tribe.

799
02:00:09,056 --> 02:00:13,756
-They'll raid our caravan! Come on!
-As you order, my bey!

800
02:00:55,175 --> 02:00:58,365
Bamsı Bey! Bamsı Bey!

801
02:03:22,295 --> 02:03:28,495
These prayer beads...
After Abdurrahman Ghazi died...

802
02:03:28,495 --> 02:03:33,035
I used it a lot.

803
02:03:38,699 --> 02:03:44,899
Now, it's time for revenge.

804
02:03:59,930 --> 02:04:05,330
Osman will lose a second father.

805
02:05:33,768 --> 02:05:40,178
I'm honored that I'll be the
last person to see you.

806
02:05:41,431 --> 02:05:46,111
But Togay, you don't know that...

807
02:05:46,111 --> 02:05:52,361
the last thing we see before dying
is an angel.

808
02:05:53,901 --> 02:05:58,481
So, take your sword.

809
02:05:59,486 --> 02:06:02,896
Take your sword, Togay.

810
02:07:51,430 --> 02:07:54,320
Togay!

811
02:08:20,890 --> 02:08:25,590
Togay! Togay! Get up!
Get up!

812
02:08:25,831 --> 02:08:29,831
Warriors! Warriors!

813
02:08:30,996 --> 02:08:34,066
Kill them!

814
02:09:55,802 --> 02:09:58,682
Bamsı Bey!

815
02:10:12,473 --> 02:10:17,463
Bamsı Bey! Bamsı Bey!
Bamsı Bey! Bamsı Bey!

816
02:10:17,693 --> 02:10:21,693
Bamsı Bey! Bamsı Bey!

817
02:10:36,834 --> 02:10:39,984
Bamsı Bey!

818
02:10:40,218 --> 02:10:43,178
Bamsı Bey! Bamsı Bey!

819
02:10:43,393 --> 02:10:48,423
Bamsı Bey! Bamsı Bey!
Bamsı Bey!

820
02:11:01,107 --> 02:11:03,757
Bamsı Bey!

821
02:11:16,973 --> 02:11:21,343
Bamsı Bey! Bamsı Bey!
Bamsı Bey!

822
02:11:21,663 --> 02:11:28,943
-Bamsı Bey! Bamsı Bey!
-His wounds are severe. Quick!

823
02:11:28,964 --> 02:11:34,436
-Alps! Prepare a sledge!
-Wait, my children.

824
02:11:34,436 --> 02:11:42,096
Your Bamsı Bey is migrating
for the last time.

825
02:11:44,512 --> 02:11:50,022
I beg you, Bamsı Bey. Don't speak
like that. You will be alright.

826
02:11:50,022 --> 02:11:54,022
Don't worry, my daughter.
Don't worry.

827
02:11:56,739 --> 02:11:59,049
Now...

828
02:12:00,337 --> 02:12:04,837
The Mongol took one more life but...

829
02:12:07,417 --> 02:12:14,637
they gave two valiant alps...

830
02:12:17,017 --> 02:12:21,017
such as Cerkutay and Göktuğ.

831
02:12:21,259 --> 02:12:25,259
Bamsı Bey...
Bamsı Bey!

832
02:12:48,286 --> 02:12:51,846
Bamsı Bey!

833
02:12:56,375 --> 02:13:00,375
Bamsı Bey!
Bamsı Bey! Bamsı Bey!

834
02:13:01,876 --> 02:13:06,966
Bamsı Bey! What happened?

835
02:13:08,578 --> 02:13:12,798
Bamsı Bey! Tell me!
What happened?

836
02:13:12,798 --> 02:13:17,528
My lion, the valiant of Ertuğrul Bey!

837
02:13:17,528 --> 02:13:21,088
My Osman.

838
02:13:23,562 --> 02:13:27,562
Did you see?
Did you see?

839
02:13:30,288 --> 02:13:35,059
I was sad that I wouldn't die a martyr.
-Bamsı Bey!

840
02:13:35,190 --> 02:13:39,190
Bamsı Bey!

841
02:13:39,190 --> 02:13:43,190
-Fate...
-No! No!

842
02:13:43,190 --> 02:13:48,650
-Fate...
-No! You'll see many migrations.

843
02:13:48,693 --> 02:13:53,203
You'll see many campaigns!
Don't!

844
02:13:53,984 --> 02:13:58,864
-Don't!
-Son...

845
02:13:59,537 --> 02:14:05,167
don't you see that it's my time?

846
02:14:11,095 --> 02:14:15,095
Now I'll see my children.

847
02:14:15,095 --> 02:14:19,095
May you see many migrations.

848
02:14:22,049 --> 02:14:26,049
Bamsı Bey, don't leave us without
a father!

849
02:14:26,049 --> 02:14:28,109
Bamsı Bey!

850
02:14:30,559 --> 02:14:34,559
-Boran.
-My bey.

851
02:14:34,559 --> 02:14:36,939
Aygül.

852
02:14:39,508 --> 02:14:43,508
-Göktuğ...
-My bey!

853
02:14:47,664 --> 02:14:52,724
Turan Alp! Turan Alp...

854
02:14:52,724 --> 02:14:56,564
give me my swords.

855
02:15:07,531 --> 02:15:11,531
Cerkutay...

856
02:15:11,531 --> 02:15:15,531
now, these are yours.

857
02:15:25,174 --> 02:15:30,404
I love you, my children.

858
02:15:35,594 --> 02:15:40,402
-Osman.
-Tell me. Tell me, Bamsı Bey.

859
02:15:41,001 --> 02:15:45,001
Now, my children are yours to protect.

860
02:15:46,924 --> 02:15:51,624
Now, I know...

861
02:15:51,624 --> 02:15:56,894
you'll take my revenge.
But...

862
02:15:57,209 --> 02:16:03,039
firstly think for your tribe.

863
02:16:03,739 --> 02:16:07,739
Bamsı Bey! Bamsı Bey!

864
02:16:10,401 --> 02:16:14,401
Osman...
Osman...

865
02:16:14,740 --> 02:16:19,750
I have never...

866
02:16:19,750 --> 02:16:24,020
doubted the state you will form.

867
02:16:24,020 --> 02:16:29,790
But the state is forever.

868
02:16:30,144 --> 02:16:34,144
The state is eternal.

869
02:16:36,104 --> 02:16:40,104
Think about this.

870
02:16:48,540 --> 02:16:53,940
-Bamsı Bey!
-Oh, Ertuğrul Bey?

871
02:16:58,092 --> 02:17:02,092
Abdurrahman Ghazi!

872
02:17:02,847 --> 02:17:06,847
Hamza! Hamza!

873
02:17:07,536 --> 02:17:11,536
My lion...

874
02:17:14,839 --> 02:17:19,699
It's time for testimony...

875
02:17:19,856 --> 02:17:23,856
it's time for testimony.

876
02:17:27,723 --> 02:17:33,843
I bear witness that there
is no god but Allah...

877
02:17:38,075 --> 02:17:42,075
and I bear witness that Muhammad is...

878
02:17:46,295 --> 02:17:52,055
the servant and Messenger...

879
02:17:52,098 --> 02:17:55,878
of Allah.

880
02:18:47,618 --> 02:18:50,928
Bamsı Bey.

881
02:18:53,039 --> 02:18:56,639
Bamsı Bey...

882
02:19:00,351 --> 02:19:04,351
A gift from my father...

883
02:19:05,067 --> 02:19:08,747
a gift from my father.

884
02:19:10,647 --> 02:19:14,647
The valiant alp who came from our
ancestral lands.

885
02:19:15,954 --> 02:19:20,914
How happy I'm for you!
How happy I'm for that...

886
02:19:21,137 --> 02:19:26,117
he who is as beautiful as his name...

887
02:19:26,347 --> 02:19:32,647
our prophet Hz.Muhammed Mustafa,
may he rest in peace...

888
02:19:34,410 --> 02:19:38,410
the bey you missed so much,
Ertuğrul Ghazi...

889
02:19:38,410 --> 02:19:42,970
Abdurrahman Ghazi,
your martyr son...

890
02:19:42,970 --> 02:19:46,970
and your beloved wife will greet you!

891
02:19:55,102 --> 02:19:59,102
Bamsı Bey...

892
02:20:02,706 --> 02:20:08,576
Now, age has ended.

893
02:20:12,313 --> 02:20:18,593
That's the oath of Osman Bey,
son of Ertuğrul Ghazi!

894
02:20:24,284 --> 02:20:28,284
A new age will start!

895
02:20:28,284 --> 02:20:33,254
For the glory of our martyrs!
It will grow with vengeance!

896
02:20:33,577 --> 02:20:37,577
These holy lands that you conquered...

897
02:20:38,020 --> 02:20:41,150
Bamsı Bey!

898
02:20:44,911 --> 02:20:48,911
Rest in peace.

899
02:20:53,580 --> 02:20:56,990
Rest in peace.